{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15112480","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15112480","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:3:1511248001:0":{"text":"거대 거미왕... 엄청 크네.","source_cn":"巨蛛王……还真是庞然大物。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCDBE9F5C22F1C235","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1511248002:0":{"text":"저, 저기... 누나. 진짜 저거랑 싸울 거야?","source_cn":"那、那个……缇洛亚，你真的打得过它吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7244F4757C2F894E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1511248003:0":{"text":"아니, 저걸 이길 수 있는 사람이 있어?","source_cn":"不对。有人打得过它吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBAE411EA07175EF9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1511248004:0":{"text":"나페이 님이 이긴 적 있어.","source_cn":"那非曾经战胜过它。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCFA8B6DCDA493514","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1511248005:0":{"text":"몇 년 전, 아쿠보르를 떠날 때 이쪽 방향으로 가셨거든.","source_cn":"几年前他脱离雅库伯尔时，就是从这个方向离开的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBF78000B24A9A979","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1511248006:0":{"text":"나페이는 신의 은총을 받았잖아. 근데 우리 누나는... 아야!","source_cn":"但那非是曾经得到过神明恩赐的勇士，缇洛亚就只是——哎哟！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD9E17CDD8AF314F6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1511248007:0":{"text":"야! 싸우기도 전에 기죽이기 있어? 난 벌써 머릿속에서 거대 거미왕을 수십 번 이겼단 말이야!","source_cn":"喂，别还没开打就败人志气！我已经在心里演练过无数次该如...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD6628969B771F300","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1511248008:1":{"text":"이 나무기름을 동쪽 공터에 부어. 그리고 내가 신호를 주면 불을 붙이면 돼.","source_cn":"拿好这瓶树油，浇到东边的空地上，等我发出信号就用火点燃。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5250720398F9C8CE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"picture:12::2":{"text":"나무기름","source_cn":"树油","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x35C3BFE7569AC136","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1511248009:0":{"text":"누가? 내가?!","source_cn":"谁？我、我吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x753ECC1A0B1B2B46","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1511248010:1":{"text":"바보야! 입만 살아선 유토피아로 못 가!","source_cn":"笨蛋！你以为跋涉去理想乡只要动动嘴皮就可以？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC6D9441925EB1E83","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1511248011:1":{"text":"용기를 내. 네가 해야 할 일이 아직 많단 말이야!","source_cn":"鼓起勇气，你以后要干的事还多着呢！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7F8BB539EF88B29A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1511248012:1":{"text":"그리고 다들 잘 들어. 아쿠보르에서 터득한 것들을 이용해야 해. 거대 거미왕이 불빛에 끌려올 때를 틈타서 밟기만 해도 바로 발동되는 가시 함정을 둥지에 놓는 거야.","source_cn":"第二步，其他人听好——拿出你们在雅库伯尔学到的本领，趁...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1F7A153C5773D8C2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1511248013:1":{"text":"내가 먼저 가서 둥지의 거미알을 처리할게. 그리고 나서는... 결전이지!","source_cn":"我会先扫灭巢穴里的蜘蛛卵。然后……就是决战。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x25742C91F47B3829","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:19:1511248013":{"text":"내가 먼저 가서 둥지의 거미알을 처리할게. 그리고 나서는... 결전이지!","source_cn":"我会先扫灭巢穴里的蜘蛛卵。然后……就是决战。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x25742C91F47B3829","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1511248014:1":{"text":"고마워. 네 호의는 마음만 받을게.","source_cn":"多谢，好意我心领了。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x25D193060C259D75","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"고마워. 네 호의는 마음만 받을게.","female":"고마워. 네 호의는 마음만 받을게.","variant_male_record_index":"190054","variant_female_record_index":"190055","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1511248016:1":{"text":"나머진 나한테 맡겨!","source_cn":"其余的，就尽管交给我吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB9335ABB5B914C4C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:22:1511248017:1":{"text":"자신감 있는 틸로아의 모습에, 모두 그녀의 계획에 따르기로 했다","source_cn":"","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1DC571434E16DCFC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:23:1511248018:1":{"text":"금세 모든 준비가 마무리되었다...","source_cn":"","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE6D9EA9097D1D908","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:19:0:1":{"text":"너 혼자?","source_cn":"你一个人？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xDE7BF32A79D80524","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"너 혼자?","female":"너 혼자?","variant_male_record_index":"79513","variant_female_record_index":"79514","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1511248015:1":{"text":"헤헤, 영웅의 칭찬을 받다니. 나 정말 잘한 걸지도 모르겠네?","source_cn":"嘿，能得到英雄夸奖，看来我干得确实不错。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x8CF50D097EA31E8D","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","m